%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 922cbf48982aa4f4ba81c16e6a7c9123, type: 3}
  m_Name: Mission4
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueData
  dialogueName: Mission4
  pauseGame: 0
  entries:
  - speakerName: Nexus
    portrait: {fileID: 4329407632164072968, guid: 768fe4dd8c6c4b24f99cb3ea39d88b98, type: 3}
    expression: {fileID: 3622792381989719942, guid: df58ce550d446d847ba3ac2c700cb826, type: 3}
    dialogueText: Commander, our Researchers can develop new structural blueprints.
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f23b2569e797cb742805cc1f5cb52faf, type: 3}
  - speakerName: Nexus
    portrait: {fileID: 4329407632164072968, guid: 768fe4dd8c6c4b24f99cb3ea39d88b98, type: 3}
    expression: {fileID: 3622792381989719942, guid: df58ce550d446d847ba3ac2c700cb826, type: 3}
    dialogueText: Given sufficient energy and time.
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 507a893b80ac24343904b344c121e6c6, type: 3}
  - speakerName: Nexus
    portrait: {fileID: 4329407632164072968, guid: 768fe4dd8c6c4b24f99cb3ea39d88b98, type: 3}
    expression: {fileID: 3622792381989719942, guid: df58ce550d446d847ba3ac2c700cb826, type: 3}
    dialogueText: A Laboratory would enable this.
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 563de2b788151654384fed438a6abd81, type: 3}
  - speakerName: Kyra-Dominia
    portrait: {fileID: 4329407632164072968, guid: ec3af396638fb02499ed390d58ca0309, type: 3}
    expression: {fileID: 3622792381989719942, guid: fcfdf3b0b75479b45ac4992a42f44486, type: 3}
    dialogueText: Engineering superiority is how we hold this ground. Build it.
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 1d26b885b888d224786eb54c017ce6f7, type: 3}
  - speakerName: Nexus
    portrait: {fileID: 4329407632164072968, guid: 768fe4dd8c6c4b24f99cb3ea39d88b98, type: 3}
    expression: {fileID: 3622792381989719942, guid: df58ce550d446d847ba3ac2c700cb826, type: 3}
    dialogueText: Our reserves are capped at baseline capacity.
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 8352b69f0e107c446a8dd015844a1168, type: 3}
  - speakerName: Nexus
    portrait: {fileID: 4329407632164072968, guid: 768fe4dd8c6c4b24f99cb3ea39d88b98, type: 3}
    expression: {fileID: 3622792381989719942, guid: df58ce550d446d847ba3ac2c700cb826, type: 3}
    dialogueText: I recommend prioritizing storage infrastructure.
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 1204443fd5ce51b4d9b3dc15d9860072, type: 3}
  - speakerName: Nexus
    portrait: {fileID: 4329407632164072968, guid: 768fe4dd8c6c4b24f99cb3ea39d88b98, type: 3}
    expression: {fileID: 3622792381989719942, guid: df58ce550d446d847ba3ac2c700cb826, type: 3}
    dialogueText: Resource Warehouses, Energy Batteries, and a Robot Bay.
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b2d10cbdb776d03419512e9f13990f78, type: 3}
  - speakerName: Nexus
    portrait: {fileID: 4329407632164072968, guid: 768fe4dd8c6c4b24f99cb3ea39d88b98, type: 3}
    expression: {fileID: 3622792381989719942, guid: df58ce550d446d847ba3ac2c700cb826, type: 3}
    dialogueText: Without expanded reserves, further expansion stalls.
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 72a6bd048fdb92f4592c4ba2b714afd6, type: 3}
  - speakerName: Kyra-Dominia
    portrait: {fileID: 4329407632164072968, guid: ec3af396638fb02499ed390d58ca0309, type: 3}
    expression: {fileID: 3622792381989719942, guid: fcfdf3b0b75479b45ac4992a42f44486, type: 3}
    dialogueText: A fortress without stockpiles is just a target. Research them all.
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 47731b54ef8974e4b83bd1ab09dd5888, type: 3}
